      <Comment source="O-27, pujar">A cDNA clone encoding a root-periphery iron transporter was isolated from iron-deficient roots of |FRAME: TAX-3701|. This cDNA was recombinantly expressed in yeast and shown to be homologous to IRT1 but lacking its broad specificity, it exclusively transports iron and zinc |CITS: [11389759]|.</Comment>
