      <Comment source="O-27, pujar">A cDNA clone encoding a transporter for high affinity metal uptake was isolated from iron starved roots of |FRAME: TAX-3701|. IRT1 knockout mutant of |FRAME: TAX-3701| is chlorotic and has severe growth defects. The IRT1 green fluroscent protein fusion gets transiently expressed in culture cells and localizes to plasma membrane |CITS: [12084823]|.</Comment>
